            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दीवार पर हरी बेल चढ़ रही है। dīvār par harī bel caṛh rahī hai. A green creeper is climbing the wall."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A different बेल (bel), masculine, is the wood-apple tree."
            }
          ]
        },
