          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बेल (bel) is a tadbhava of Sanskrit velli, \"a creeping plant\" (CDIAL 12123), which lists Hindi bel, \"creeper\"."
